window.products.push({"id":1009026,"name":"Vornado Evap40 4-Gallon Evaporative Humidifier with Adjustable Humidistat and 3 Speeds & MD1-0034 Replacement Humidifier Wick (Pack of 2), White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":142.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nLI7h7IQL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Vornado Evap40 4-Gallon Evaporative Humidifier with Adjustable Humidistat and 3 SpeedsIMPORTANT INTERNATIONAL DISCLAIMER: This item is built to meet U.S. voltage requirements and may not function properly when used in conjunction with external devices that alter or convert voltage or frequency of electricity. Improper use or shipping the product outside the U.S. will void all warranties.The Evap40 Whole Room Evaporative Vortex Humidifier creates a comfortable, perfectly humidified living space quickly and quietly. Vornado's deep pitch blades pull large volumes of harsh, dry air through two humidifying filters, and then, using Vornado's signature Vortex Action, circulates the humidified air throughout the room, providing complete and uniform humidification in spaces up to 1,000 sq. ft. The Evap40 delivers automatic humidity control with a built-in humidistat. An easy-to-use control panel allows you to choose your desired humidity level and fan speed (low, medium, or high). Its extra-large 4 gallon capacity provides up to a 4 gallon water output when operated continuously on high, allowing for long, uninterrupted operation and fewer refills. Backed by Vornado's 5 year limited warranty. Do not use gasoline, thinners, solvents or other chemicals for cleaning. Humidifier components are not dishwasher safe. Do not submerge humidifier tops in water. Power: 43 Watts.Vornado MD1-0034 Replacement Humidifier Wick (2-Pack)IMPORTANT INTERNATIONAL DISCLAIMER: This item is built to meet U.S. voltage requirements and may not function properly when used in conjunction with external devices that alter or convert voltage or frequency of electricity. Improper use or shipping the product outside the U.S. will void all warranties.At 1-inch thick, these Vornado MD1-0034 Humidifier Replacement Wicks (2-Pack) are designed to fit Vornado EV100, EV200, EVDC300, EVDC500, Evap2, and Evap40 evaporative humidifiers. An antimicrobial treatment helps protect the wick filter from bacteria growth. No cleaning is required and the wicks are disposable. The superior performance promised of Vornado's evaporative humidifiers is realized only when genuine Vornado wicks are used and replaced at the recommended intervals. While other brands may fit our units, these wicks do not carry the same quality and life as our own and can diminish the humidifier’s performance. Vornado wicks are developed from the highest quality materials that work to absorb the maximum amount of water while filtering the circulating air.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nLI7h7IQL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vornado","source_asin":"B08YGHSSFL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YGHSSFL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YGHSSFL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
