window.products.push({"id":1009065,"name":"New Electric Quiet Mini Dehumidifier 500ML(16.9 oz) Capacity Compact and Portable for High Humidity in Home Kitchen Bedroom Bathroom Basement Caravan ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619MmWr1-RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All our dehumidifiers have been carefully tested by our professional in-house engineering team. All our dehumidifiers utilize advanced technology which is not only extremely energy efficient but whisper-quiet too. Our Designs are modern and compact, fit perfectly into your daily life.  It is perfect for use in small spaces such as your kitchen, garage, basement, caravan, wardrobe, boat. Quickly By removing the excess water in any part of your place, our dehumidifier can provide greater comfort for your life. Dehumidifier protects your home and stays away from the excess water circumstances. Make your life full of ease.  ★ Absorb excess water ★ Easy to use to provide you a comfortable and enjoyable life. ★ Compressor free, no chemicals, no moving parts. ★ Energy-efficient with low power consumption. Material: ABS plastic. Package includes: 1 x Dehumidifier 1 x Power Cable 1 x Instruction Manual 1 x External water pipe  Operation 1. Make sure the water tank is installed. Plug the dehumidifier and the power light will turn on (blue), which means the dehumidifier will run normally, if the light is red, please check if the water tank is in the position.  2. When the water tank is full, the dehumidifier will stop running automatically, and the red light will turn on. Before you remove the tank, please cut off the power supply.  3. Take out and drain the water tank, wipe and dry the dehumidifier. 4. If the red indicator lights on, please check if the water tank is in the correct position.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619MmWr1-RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unique ZONE","source_asin":"B087D1PVHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087D1PVHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087D1PVHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
