window.products.push({"id":1009074,"name":"Bedsure Firm Pillows Queen Size Set of 2 - Supportive Down Alternative Gusseted Bed Pillow for Side and Back Sleepers, Comfortable Fluffy Hotel Qualit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ppaodTubL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Comfort Supportive: Bedsure hotel pillows are filled with 100% high-quality down alternative virgin fiber which has stronger support than ordinary 3d fiber for a pleasing plumpness, making them best for side sleepers; Good resilience providing gentle adequate comfort makes our bed pillows suitable for stomach and back sleepers too. Safe & Machine Washable: Our sleep pillow sets are certificated by Oeko-tex ensures textiles meet high safety and environmental standards. Our premium sleep pillows can be machine washed for deep cleaning. The hypoallergenic breathable pillows support your every sweet night's dream. Quality Cover: The skin-friendly and durable fabric shell provides a smooth finish and soft feeling, making you feel like sleeping on a cloud. The white shell is diamond embossed to make our pillow look more fashionable, beautiful, unique and luxurious for bedroom. Dual Band Design: The fluffy bedding pillows with high-end dual band design and no-shift construction ensures the pillow hold its shape and don't go flatten, fits the body's natural curve. Red and blue-colored cording edge make our luxury pillows look more textured. Confident to Buy: You will receive 2 queen size pillows measure 18x28in, can be used with most standard pillowcases, really nice gifts to your family and friends. Compress packed for shipping. Upon receipt, gently pat the pillows and let them expand for up to 48 hours before first use. Kind Tips: Our high resilience silicone oil washed fibers have a slow recovery after compression, please pat them from all sides to the middle of the pillow after unpacking and wait 48 hours to get full fluff before first use. Kind Tips: Set the dryer to a low heat and put your pillow in the dryer with a tennis ball. Turn the dryer on for around 20 minutes, the pillow will be very fluffy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ppaodTubL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEDSURE","source_asin":"B0B38ZP27Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009074","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B38ZP27Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B38ZP27Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
