window.products.push({"id":1009130,"name":"Mini Bronze Wealth Inviting Arowana on Treasure Fish Life-Like Detail Lucky Feng Shui Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8118yMHo3SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Arowana, also known by the Chinese as the “golden dragon” or “living dragon”, is a very influential icon among all other water-dwelling creatures. It is believed to bring all kinds of blessings to your home and family, some of these being increased income, prevention of accidents and harm, protection and guardianship, as well as an enhancement of surrounding chi flow. In Feng Shui, this good luck symbol is highly revered, and can be placed in a number of ways around your home. Here are some Feng Shui tips on its placement: 1) To enhance the blessings and attract wealth luck for all family members, display the Arowana in prominent locations around your home, such as the main hall, living room, dining room or bedroom. 2) If you already have waterfalls, aquariums or ponds placed around your home according to Feng Shui, you can display the Arowana beside or inside these water elements to attract torrent of wealth luck. 3) This lucky charm is ideal for influential people such as managers and bosses, as well as employees, to represent personal development and optimized money-making opportunities. In addition, the Arowana is said to bring out your best characteristics and allow you to keep your game sharp to conquer competition. 4) According to Feng Shui Bagua formula, the North sector is the creator of career luck. Placing this good luck charm in this sector of your living room, dining room or office is believed to win you windfall luck and optimize your career opportunities. 5) To increase your wealth luck, place an Arowana in the angle diagonal to the main entrance of your home or office, or on the Southeast corner of the cash register counter or the reception desk of an office. 6) You can determine you Sheng Chi direction according to your Feng Shui Kua Formula. When found, place the Feng Shui Arowana in this path to enhance wealth luck.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8118yMHo3SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LuckyGifts","source_asin":"B0838Q1K2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0838Q1K2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0838Q1K2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
