window.products.push({"id":1009239,"name":"NILWL Clothes Drying Rack for Laundry,Metal Clothes Racks for Hanging Clothes,Clothes Drying Rack indoor,Drying Rack for Underwear,Bra,Baby Clothes,To","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616OkqvLLXL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Clothes Drying Rack with 10 Clips,Stainless Steel Metal Drying Racks for Laundry,Clothes Racks for Hanging Clothes,Bra Towels,Socks,Underwears,Gloves,Diapers,Scarf,Baby Clothes(3 Pack) This stainless steel clothes drying rack is made of high quality stainless steel, which is durable, strong in bearing and corrosion resistance.Compared to plastic drying racks, stainless steel clothes drying racks are more sturdy and have a longer life,and are not as easily broken as plastic drying racks. Multi-used Laundry Drying Rack This clothes drying rack suitable for a variety of scenarios.The clothes rack can be used for hanging socks,bra, underwear,cloth diapers,towels,scarves,hat,ties,handkerchief,underwear,gloves,baby clothes and other small items. The clothes rack can be used not only indoors but also outdoors. It can be hung on clothesline, shower curtain bar, laundry room, wardrobe, etc.(in areas with high humidity or salt, we recommend using clothes-racks indoors.) Durable Windbreak Hook & Save Space The drying rack is equipped with windproof hook, which can prevent the clothes on the clothes rack from being blown away by the wind. The clothes drying rack can be drying more clothes, greatly save space. The gap has certain distance between two clip,which can be helpful for the clothings is insolated by sunshine,so that can fast bask in dry clothings. Whether Stainless Steel Products Will Rust Stainless steel product is rust and anticorrosive ability is strong.Stainless steel products can not be used in the seaside, because of the strong alkaline seaside.Stainless steel product itself will not rust, please avoid contact with acid, alkali or liquid for a long time,clean it in time after use and keep the product dry.The stainless steel products last longer than plastic products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616OkqvLLXL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NILWL","source_asin":"B07Y75SZ8Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y75SZ8Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y75SZ8Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
