window.products.push({"id":1009362,"name":"Lumicook Sticker Wood Recipe Box with 120 Double Sided Cards and 7 Dividers | Bamboo Recipe Card Box with Phone and Card Holder Gift for Mom, Women, W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BCN95hbFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎍 PREMIUM BAMBOO WOOD RECIPE BOX - Our recipe box is made from quality Bamboo Wood Material and finished with high quality hinges to protect your most cherished recipes, from your heirloom recipes to your own creations, so you can pass them on for generations to come. It measures 17.5cm*12.5cm*13cm and can perfectly fit 4 x 6-inch recipe cards and dividers. It also comes with 120 White Recipe cards and 7 dividers. 📝 ORGANIZE YOUR RECIPES - This bamboo wood recipe organizer is an excellent method to keep all of your important recipes safe and organized in one location. Our adorable recipe box has a slant opening on top where you can safely store your phone and/or recipe cards for easy viewing while cooking without touching them. Place 1 recipe card on top of the wood box for easy viewing and cooking. 🌏 BEAUTIFULLY DESIGN & ECO FRIENDLY - This bamboo recipe cards box is made of eco-friendly bamboo and has an exquisite wood design. Our recipe box has a lovely dark brown finish and trendy recipe cards with pineapple, watermelon, oranges, and lemons – it's a delightful stylish kitchen item. Protecting and keeping treasured recipes in one convenient location, while also creating a warm and inviting accent to your house. 👨🏼‍🍳 FITS ANY KITCHEN - This bamboo wooden box with hinged top will lend a classic touch to your home and will fit perfectly with any kitchen design, providing it a pleasant way to store your recipe cards. The recipe bin's lid features a stand-up slot for storing your culinary secrets, allowing you to readily view the recipe without touching it. 🎁 THE PERFECT THOUGHTFUL GIFT - For those who enjoy cooking, this is a fantastic gift idea. This vintage yet modern recipe box with cards and dividers gift set is ideal for birthdays, Christmas, Mother's Day, Father's Day, bridal showers, and weddings. Fill out a handful of the cards with your favorite recipes and place them in the recipe box with a photo and a note on the back to give them a gift they'll treasure forever!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BCN95hbFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lumicook","source_asin":"B09G3BCFGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G3BCFGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G3BCFGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
