window.products.push({"id":1009395,"name":"ZY Cast Iron Skillet - Best Heavy-Duty Professional Restaurant Chef Quality Pre-Seasoned Pan Cookware - 10\" Pans - Great For Frying,Saute,Cooking,Pizz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zxy1r-oTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cast iron skillets are a timeless must-have for every kitchen! The ZY Cast Iron Skillet is heavy duty and virtually indestructible,so they will last you years,decades,and generations to come!Our skillets are factory pre-seasoned,so they are ready to use straight out of the box.Our cast iron cookware is multi-functional,and suitable for many different cooking methods. Use them on the stovetop,in the oven,over a campfire,and even when slow-cooking!They're perfect for frying, sauteing,cooking,grilling,and more.Plus our design has superior heat retention and conducts heat evenly,so your food will turn out great every time! Care Instructions It is very natural for iron to rust without seasoning but there is nothing to worry.It's really easy to fix. Simply scrub the rust,rinse,dry,and cover with a little vegetable oil.If the problem persists,you will need to thoroughly remove all the rust and follow re-seasoning instructions given below:  1: Wash the cookware with hot,soapy water and a stiff brush.It is perfectly fine to use soap this time because you are recreating the seasoning from the scratch. 2: After washing,rinse and dry the cookware completely. 3: Apply a thin,even layer of melted solid vegetable fat (or cooking oil of your choice) to the cookware inside and out.Make sure not to use too much oil as it will result in a sticky glaze. 4: To grab any oil drips,place aluminum foil on the bottom rack of the oven and set the oven temperature to 350–400 degrees F. 5: Then put the cookware upside down on the top rack of the oven. Bake it for at least an hour. After an hour, turn the oven off and let it cool in the oven. 6: After the cooling process,store it open in a dry place. 7: Repeat the process as required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zxy1r-oTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZY","source_asin":"B075WSYRDJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009395","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075WSYRDJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075WSYRDJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
