window.products.push({"id":1009441,"name":"Fantasia Materials: 4 lbs Bulk Rough India Stone Mix","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-+BkE78WL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The Fantasia brand of Indian rough stones you are ordering is a Premium Mix that we import by the ton directly from India to Fantasia Mining's USA rock yard. We supply this exclusive mix to rock shops, resellers and the general public. These stones are a large 1\" to 1.75\" average size and are perfect for tumbling, polishing, cabbing, cutting, wire wrapping or keeping in their natural forms as specimens. Your order will contain multiple pieces of this spectacular material of varying natural sizes, shapes, types and patterns as shown in the images which is equal to or greater than the weight purchased.The materials we use in this mix include: Amazonite, Amethyst, Black Jasper, Black Volcano, Blue/Grey Agate, Crystal Quartz, Dalmatian Jasper, Fancy Jasper, Garnet, Green Aventurine, Green Jasper, Heena Jasper, Iolite, Landscape Jasper, Lapis Lazuli, Leopard Jasper, Moonstone, Picasso Jasper, Red Carnelian, Rose Quartz, Sodalite, Sunstone, Tiger Jasper, Tree Agate, Unakite, Volcano Coffee, White King Quartz and Yellow Aventurine!VERY IMPORTANT: While we do our best to make sure all 28 stone types are in each and every bag, it is possible that you may not receive every single stone type listed. In virtually all cases you will find between 25-28 different types of stones from this list with your order.This is rough natural material which means you are receiving it exactly how it came out of the ground. All pictures were taken with the stones being wet which helps to show the materials true colors and clarity. It may not have the same appearance when dry unless it has been polished, tumbled, or cabbed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-+BkE78WL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fantasia","source_asin":"B013ZNSLKY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013ZNSLKY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013ZNSLKY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
