window.products.push({"id":1009454,"name":"BeldiNest Olive Wood Meat Tenderizer & Potato Masher-Multifunctional Kitchen Tool for Smooth Mashed Potatoes, Softened Vegetables, Mincing Garlic and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LxJvjaU9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE APPLICATION: A meat tenderizer offers versatile applications beyond tenderizing meat, including mashing potatoes, tenderizing tough vegetables, crushing garlic and ginger, pounding chicken cutlets, cracking nuts, preparing crumbs or crackers, and tenderizing other meats. It serves as a multi-purpose tool in the kitchen, allowing you to achieve smooth mashed potatoes, soften fibrous vegetables, mince garlic and ginger, flatten chicken for even cooking, and crack nuts. FOOD SAFE: Our spoon is eco-friendly and made from 100% natural olive wood. We finish the wood with only vegetable or olive oil, ensuring its safety from food contact. It's easy to care for, has a modern and functional design, and provides a comfortable cooking grip. STUNNING DESIGN & UNIQUE GRAIN: Experience the captivating design and amazing grain patterns of our olive wood meat tenderizer and potato masher. The olive wood grain varies yearly and depends on the growing conditions, making each handmade wooden spoon unique. With its comfortable design and ravishing grain, this spoon is a true work of art. EXQUISITE CRAFTSMANSHIP: Prepare to be enchanted by the remarkable craftsmanship of our stunning olive meat tenderizer and potato masher. Each masher is meticulously crafted from a solid piece of durable and dense olive wood, ensuring its longevity and strength. With a focus on elegance and classiness, this meat tenderizer and potato masher elevate your culinary experience and add sophistication to your kitchen. IDEAL KITCHEN GIFT: Delight loved ones with our olive wood meat tenderizer and potato masher! Perfect for holidays, Christmas, Father's Day, Mother's Day, birthdays, housewarmings, or any occasion. This elegant and thoughtful present is ideal for a wife, husband, girlfriend, mom, or grandma. Carefully crafted, it showcases olive wood's natural beauty, adding functionality and sophistication to their kitchen. A delightful addition! CARE FOR OLIVE WOOD: Keep your olive wood items in top condition by gently washing them with mild dish soap and warm water, ensuring thorough drying afterward. Maintain moisture and prevent drying by occasionally applying food-safe mineral or olive oil. Avoid soaking, direct heat exposure, and dishwasher use. Polish with a food-safe wood conditioner, handle carefully and store in a cool, dry place. APPROX DIMENSIONS. Length: 8\" diameter of the base 2.75\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LxJvjaU9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeldiNest","source_asin":"B01M3ULVI1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009454","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M3ULVI1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M3ULVI1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
