window.products.push({"id":1009498,"name":"TOMOON Humidifier Tank Cleaner Fish for Warm & Cool Mist Humidifiers,Drop,Droplet,Adorable,Fish Tank,Aquarium（16 Pack Two Colors）","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DCXRBmJ-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🐠【UNIVERSAL MOST HUMIDIFIERS】 Package includes 16 packs of humidifier cleaning fish (8 blue and 8 purple), compatible with most warm & cold humidity humidifiers/drops/cute humidifiers, can be used with humidifier wick suction filters, also can be used in fish tanks, aquariums, etc. Please note that the diameter of your humidifier opening is at least 1.8 inches. Please check if the opening is large enough to fit these fish filter humidifiers. 🐟【NANO-GRADE MATERIAL】Our cool mist humidifier cleaner fish has excellent cleaning performance, made of impact-resistant ABS plastic, the composition is safe, not easy to break and leak. Nano-silver ions are added and evenly distributed on the surface and inside the ball. It does not contain irritating substances, has strong stability, and effectively reduces the amount of white minerals. 🐳【PURIFYING WATER QUALITY】 Using humidifier tank cleaner fish can effectively reduce the accumulation of white matter caused by Mg²+ and CA²+ in hard water, and remove more than 90% of unpleasan odors. Keeping your tank clean as new provides you and your family with a cleaner, gentler mist output, while extending your humidifier's water absorption and effective lifespan. 🐬【EFFORTLESS REPLACEMENT】The fish for humidifier cleaner is the perfect helper to keep your humidifier and tank clean. It is effortless to use. Just throw it into the humidifier or fish tank and let the little fish swim around freely. It can effectively reduce the frequency of cleaning the humidifier. It is recommended to use 2 fish per 1 gallon tank, or change the filter in about 30-40 days, depending on the water hardness and frequency of use. 💐【BUY WITH CONFIDENCE】Shop risk-free, if you are not completely satisfied with our fish filter humidifier you can request a replacement or a full refund within 30 days. Any questions please feel free to contact our customer service team, online 24*7, we will show you a sincere attitude and give you a satisfactory solution!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DCXRBmJ-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOMOON","source_asin":"B0BJD9W9L9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJD9W9L9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJD9W9L9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
