window.products.push({"id":1009613,"name":"Oneida Satin Aquarius 2-Piece Entertainment Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Q4VYP5SVL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description This pattern is sleek and satiny to the touch. The bright overlapping curve gives Satin Aquarius a zodiac-inspired twist. Great for family dining or entertaining, combining durability with a lustrous finish. Oneida, the leading name in flatware, has been setting tables for generations. Oneida's highest quality stainless steel flatware, the 2-piece entertainment set includes casserole spoon and servall. Amazon.com The graceful, sociable look of this two-piece entertainment set of Satin Aquarius flatware is perfect for serving guests and family on intimate occasions. The set includes a casserole spoon and a slotted servall, each with a gently tapered handle that finishes in a comfortable rounded end. A sinuous mirror-finish line curves across the satin-finish surface, and a gleaming working end underscores the pleasing contrast. Pleasantly hefty, the flatware is crafted from 18/10 stainless steel with 18 percent chrome for corrosion resistance and 10 percent nickel for luster. The pieces are safe in the dishwasher and carry a lifetime warranty. Satin Aquarius is also part of Oneida's Patterns for a Lifetime program, so you can expand or refine your collection whenever you like. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box Entertainment serving set. Set includes: casserole spoon; slotted servall. 2 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Q4VYP5SVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oneida","source_asin":"B0000AZWEU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000AZWEU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000AZWEU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
