window.products.push({"id":1009684,"name":"Mundial 5100 Series 10-Piece Knife Set with Block, Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RKWSRN11L._AC_.jpg","description":"A stylishly unique collection of cutlery, this 10-piece block set will make even a beginner chef feel like a pro. Knives include a 2-1/2-inch peeling knife, 3-1/2-inch paring, 6-inch serrated utility, and an 8-inch chef's knife, as well as an 8-inch serrated bread knife and an 8-inch carving knife. The peeling knife works great for peeling small fruits and vegetables quickly and easily, while the paring knife nicely handles small cutting tasks. Use the serrated utility for slicing foods such as tomatoes and small breads, and the chef's knife for chopping, dicing, and slicing any size or type of food. The bread knife is a must-have in any busy kitchen, and the carving set includes not only the carving knife for slicing meat with ease, but also a straight-tined fork for holding food in place. All the knives have fully forged one-piece construction, a full tang, and high-carbon stainless-steel blades. In addition, perfectly balanced, ergonomic, three-riveted handles ensure a comfortable, firm grip. The set's 10-inch sharpening steel restores that \"just-out-of-the box\" edge to all the knives, while the kitchen shears with take-a-part blades make cleaning effortless. A solid wood block completes the set, providing a safe, convenient storage place and an attractive presentation on any kitchen counter. The knives should be washed by hand. Made in Brazil and designed exclusively in support of the National Breast Cancer Foundation, the 10-piece cutlery block set measures 11 by 4-1/2 by 14 inches and carries a limited lifetime warranty against defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41RKWSRN11L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mundial","source_asin":"B000G29L2U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009684","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000G29L2U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000G29L2U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
