window.products.push({"id":1009706,"name":"ANKEVIN Door Draft Stopper 36\",Draft Stopper for Bottom of Door,Under Door Draft Stopper,Front Door Draft Stopper Weather Stripping Fits 0 to 2.5\" Doo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ml0jv2JVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Have you met this kind of problems? 1. air condition can't keep your room cold or warm. 2. Always have dust on your surface. 3.Noise reduces your sleep quality. 4. Your floor usually gets soaked after winding and raining This is the reason we need these door draft stoppers. New upgrade door draft stopper New upgrade door draft stopper fits door gaps 0-2.5” for standard size 36” door, The upgrade right-angled triangle design forms a right-angled triangle between the floor/carpet and the door. which can efficiently block cold drafts/breeze from entering the room and stay the warm air in the home.The under door draft stopper with two hanging loops,Stores neatly when not in use with its built-in hanging loop. What does a door draft block? Our draft stopper for bottom of door covers the entire width and gap of your door to effectively block lights, sounds, odors, smoke, heat, cold drafts, dust, and unwanted nature dwellers from entering your home. In addition, they work well year round. During the hotter summer months, the draft stopper prevents cold air from escaping, while in the winter months, prevents    heat from escaping; this ensures your home is always at the ideal temperature. Does it work on all floors? Unlike other door draft stoppers that get stuck on certain flooring, our foam door sweep works on all types of flooring including carpet, tile, vinyl, and wood. Our front door draft stopper won’t resist, allowing you to open and close your doors with    ease. Benefits of draft stopper? With this door draft blocker, you can say goodbye to these situations. After installing on the door, it is very tight to keep warm and cold air out of the room to create a comfortable environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ml0jv2JVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANKEVIN","source_asin":"B0BXHC6ZC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009706","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXHC6ZC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXHC6ZC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
