window.products.push({"id":1009755,"name":"Newhai Commercial Potato Slicer Fruit Vegetable Slicing Machine Cabbage Shredder Rebanadora de Vegetale for Onions Potatoes Lemons","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kjeqJCf0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"0.38mm-8mm THICKNESS ADJUSTABLE---This vegetable and fruit slicer features an adjustable thickness setting, with a range of 0.38mm-8mm (0.015”-0.3’’) available. To adjust the slice thickness, simply turn the knob located on the manual potato slicer. Turning the knob clockwise will achieve a thicker slice, while turning it counterclockwise will create a thinner slice. With this level of versatility and control, you can easily achieve the perfect slice thickness for all of your fruits and vegetables, making meal preparation a breeze. HIGH QUALITY SPACE ALUMINUM---Crafted from premium 6030 space aluminum, this vegetable cutter offers long-lasting performance. Its pure material composition and unique structure ensure resistance to acid and alkali, while the formation of alumina on the surface protects the professional slicer machine and prevents rusting. This construction and protective coating ensures maximum durability and a longer lifespan for your slicer machine, even under intense daily use. IRON NICKEL ALLOY BLADE---Crafted from premium iron nickel alloy, the blade of this manual cabbage shredder is highly resistant to rust, ensuring long-lasting durability and reliable performance. Additionally, cleaning this shredder is a breeze, as it can be easily washed with water directly. With this manual cabbage shredder, you can enjoy the nice shredding experience every time, while enjoying the peace of mind that comes with owning a superior product designed for lasting durability. STABLE TO USE---This heavy-duty slicer comes equipped with a sturdy, reliable fixing screw located on the bottom. This feature is designed to securely fasten the slicer to any tabletop or other flat surface, effectively preventing any shaky movements during use. With its robust construction and advanced fixing mechanism, this heavy-duty slicer is the go-to tool for any commercial or home kitchen looking for good performance and lasting durability. APPLICATIONS---With its versatile and adjustable design, this vegetable slicer is perfect for a wide range of applications, making it an indispensable tool for families, restaurants, fruit shops, milk tea shops, and more. And if you're looking for the perfect gift for your wife, friend, or loved one on their birthday or other special occasion, this vegetable slicer makes an excellent choice. So give the gift of convenience and delicious, perfectly-sliced veggies with this easy-to-use, highly functional vegetable slicer today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91kjeqJCf0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Newhai","source_asin":"B0922MDBJV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0922MDBJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0922MDBJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
