window.products.push({"id":1009765,"name":"HOTIME Chef Knife 8.5 Inch Carbon Steel Kitchen Knifes for Professional Use With Shark Shape Handle and Gift Box, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UHBc8R5vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM GERMAN STEEL: Our kitchen chef’s knife is made of high carbon German Steel 1.4116 which contains 14% to 15% chromium and 0.45% to 0.55% carbon element. High chromium and carbon content improves hardness, flexibility, oxidation & corrosion resistance and is not easy to rust. 8.5 INCH CHEF KNIFE: The HOTIME 8.5\" cooking knife is designed to be professional chefs knife, also can be used for your daily kitchen tasks to cutting, chopping, slicing and dicing of meat, vegetable, fruit, cheese, sushi etc. The multi-functional knife is suitable for both home and restaurant kitchens. RAZOR SHARP CHEF’S KNIVES: Each “chef” is most care about Sharpness. The thickness of this kitchen knife is 2.2mm and the blade edge angle is 15 degrees per side. Our Chefs knives are hand polished by craftsmen with decades of experience to ensure its sharpness and durability for effortless cutting and chopping. ERGONOMIC HANDLE DESIGN: Ergonomic ABS handle minimizes wrist tension while providing a secure, comfortable grip for long time using. Three rivet handle provides more stability perfectly. Easy to cut and slice. ELEGANT GIFT PACKAGING - Package includes 1 pcs chef’s knife with black gift box that would be a perfect gift for your families and friends. The kitchen sharp knife is designed as a multipurpose knife ideal for professionals including chefs, culinary experts, food caterers as well as ordinary users.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UHBc8R5vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOTIME","source_asin":"B091F9JN24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009765","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091F9JN24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091F9JN24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1009766,"name":"EXCITING EASY TO READ GRAPHICS. ChimGard® Energy Meter (3-4) Woodstove Thermometer. Durable genuine porcelain enamel with yellow, orange and red zones","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418k0QVU2lL._AC_.jpg","description":"If you're using a woodstove, you need to know what's going on inside your chimney. If you're burning too cold, you could be coating your chimney with creosote, sending massive amounts of particulate matter into the atmosphere, and losing quite a bit of heat from your wood. If you're burning too hot, you could be wasting energy, damaging your catalytic combustor or even chancing a chimney fire. It's important that you know exactly what's happening, so you can burn efficiently, stay comfortable, and most importantly, stay SAFE. Condar patented surface thermometers are bimetal instruments that attach magnetically to your stove or flue pipe. They indicate the surface temperature, and by extension the temperature of the flue gasses. They're instrumental in fine tuning your burning habits for maximum safety and efficiency. The ChimGard 3-4 Thermometer is the most popular surface thermometer for use on single-walled stove pipe. Colored \"zones\" on the enamelled steel face indicate safe burning temperatures, letting you know what's going on. A cool-touch metal bail allows you to move the magnetic thermometer wherever you wish on the pipe, or you may use the safety screw (included) to insure the thermometer stays exactly where you want it, with no chance of slipping off the pipe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418k0QVU2lL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Condar","source_asin":"B0011BDPX6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0011BDPX6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0011BDPX6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
