window.products.push({"id":1009829,"name":"Selvaggio Cord Organizer for Kitchen Appliances, Appliance Cord Organizer Stick On, Cord Wrappers for Kitchen Appliances, Kitchen Aid Mixers Accessori","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yxE7S3HNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your sanctuary of cleanliness begins with the Selvaggio Cord Organizer How many times do you come home only to find that your kitchen’s a mess? We know what it’s like because that’s what happened to us . . . or at least it used to.   The Selvaggio Cord Organizer was designed to make your life easier and cleaner. We know that you drink coffee, use your toaster oven, we know that you’re a big fan of your air-fryer. We know this because we are too! All these things make our lives better, but with them come their gosh-darn cords. Cords that if left undone will trip you, will cause mayhem and chaos on your kitchen table and we can’t have that. We just can’t! Does your kitchen table look like the secret lair of Dr. Octopus? You know Dr. Octopus, the villain who had metal tentacles coming out of his back? That’s what your kitchen looks like right now. Admit it. But that’s okay. We’ve got your back! 😊 Mixers, Blenders, Toaster Ovens, Coffee-Makers, Pressure-Cookers and Air-Fryers . . . the modern-day kitchen is incomplete without all of our cooking gadgets. We’d be lost without them eating out 6 nights a week. Thankfully on night 7 mom invites us over for dinner. Thanks mom! We love you.   All these gadgets come with cords, cords, and more cords. We finish cooking and then what? We must clean. We’ve designed the Selvaggio Cord Organizer so that you have to do the least amount of work possible! When you’re done cooking, just wrap the cord of any kitchen appliance around it so that it’s not laying out on your countertop getting in your way. It’s that easy! Kitchen cord organizers have never looked so good The Selvaggio Cord Organizer was built to last. Other cord organizers fall off after 3 days, or don’t even stick at all. Our hefty little gadget was made to stick, and it was made to last! The ultimate cord taming tool has finally hit the market. Get yours now! 😊","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yxE7S3HNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Selvaggio","source_asin":"B0BQFTLHQX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1009829","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQFTLHQX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQFTLHQX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
